      <div style="background: #dbeafe; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;"><strong style="color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 12px;">15–20 · Intermediários</strong></div>
      <div style="background: #fef3c7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #eab308;"><strong style="color: #713f12; font-size: 12px;">21–26 · Alta dep.</strong></div>
      <div style="background: #fed7aa; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;"><strong style="color: #7c2d12; font-size: 12px;">27–31 · Semi-int.</strong></div>
      <div style="background: #fee2e2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;"><strong style="color: #7f1d1d; font-size: 12px;">≥32 · Intensivos</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div style="background: #faf5ff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7;"><strong style="color: #581c87;">💡 Dica da Enfa:</strong> <span style="color: #3b0764;">Aplique diariamente para justificar a escala junto à gestão.</span></div>
